#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:93
msgid "[You are banished from %H for betraying your allegiance to %d.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:95
msgid ""
"\"You have betrayed all those who hold allegiance to %d, as you once did.\n"
"My allegiance to %d holds fast and I cannot condone or accept what you\n"
"have done.\n"
"\n"
"Leave this place.  You shall never set foot at %H again.\n"
"That which you seek is now lost forever, for without the Bell of Opening,\n"
"you will never be able to enter the place where he who has the Amulet\n"
"resides.\n"
"\n"
"Go now!  You are banished from this place."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:136 dat/quest.lua:158
msgid "[%dC has chosen you to recover the Amulet of Yendor for %dI.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:138
msgid ""
"It is written in the Book of %d:\n"
"\n"
"    After the Creation, the cruel god Moloch rebelled\n"
"    against the authority of Marduk the Creator.\n"
"    Moloch stole from Marduk the most powerful of all\n"
"    the artifacts of the gods, the Amulet of Yendor,\n"
"    and he hid it in the dark cavities of Gehennom, the\n"
"    Under World, where he now lurks, and bides his time.\n"
"\n"
"Your %G %d seeks to possess the Amulet, and with it\n"
"to gain deserved ascendance over the other gods.\n"
"\n"
"You, a newly trained %r, have been heralded\n"
"from birth as the instrument of %d.  You are destined\n"
"to recover the Amulet for your deity, or die in the\n"
"attempt.  Your hour of destiny has come.  For the sake\n"
"of us all:  Go bravely with %d!"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:160
msgid ""
"It is written in the Book of %d:\n"
"\n"
"    After the Creation, the cruel god Moloch rebelled\n"
"    against the authority of Marduk the Creator.\n"
"    Moloch stole from Marduk the most powerful of all\n"
"    the artifacts of the gods, the Amulet of Yendor,\n"
"    and he hid it in the dark cavities of Gehennom, the\n"
"    Under World, where he now lurks, and bides his time.\n"
"\n"
"Your %G %d seeks to possess the Amulet, and with it\n"
"to gain deserved ascendance over the other gods.\n"
"\n"
"You, an untrained %r, have been unable to adequately\n"
"prepare to be the instrument of %d.  Nevertheless, you\n"
"are destined to recover the Amulet for your deity, or die\n"
"in the attempt.  Your hour of destiny has come.  For the\n"
"sake of us all:  Go bravely with %d!"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:179
msgid ""
"\"The silver bell which was hoarded by %n will be\n"
"essential in locating the Amulet of Yendor.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:184
msgid ""
"You receive a faint telepathic message from %l:\n"
"Your help is urgently needed at %H!\n"
"Look for a ...ic transporter.\n"
"You couldn't quite make out that last message."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:190
msgid "You again sense %l pleading for help."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:193
msgid "You again sense %l demanding your attendance."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:198
msgid "[%nC has stolen %o.  Locate %i, defeat %ni, and return %O.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:200
msgid ""
"\"Grave times have befallen the college, for %na has\n"
"stolen %o.  Without it, the board of directors of\n"
"the university will soon have no choice but to revoke our research grants.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must locate the entrance to %i.  Within it,\n"
"you will find %n.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must then defeat %n and return %o\n"
"to me.\n"
"\n"
"\"Only in this way will we be able to prevent the budget cuts that could\n"
"close this college.\n"
"\n"
"\"May the wisdom of %d be your guide.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:216 dat/quest.lua:321 dat/quest.lua:328 dat/quest.lua:355
#: dat/quest.lua:363 dat/quest.lua:397 dat/quest.lua:409 dat/quest.lua:417
#: dat/quest.lua:444 dat/quest.lua:452 dat/quest.lua:530 dat/quest.lua:563
#: dat/quest.lua:571 dat/quest.lua:637 dat/quest.lua:677 dat/quest.lua:685
#: dat/quest.lua:768 dat/quest.lua:785 dat/quest.lua:795 dat/quest.lua:845
#: dat/quest.lua:859 dat/quest.lua:990 dat/quest.lua:1054 dat/quest.lua:2229
#: dat/quest.lua:2611 dat/quest.lua:2787 dat/quest.lua:2813 dat/quest.lua:3009
#: dat/quest.lua:3028 dat/quest.lua:3038
msgid "[\\"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:218
msgid ""
"\"%pC!  I've heard that you've been using sloppy techniques.  Your\n"
"results lately can hardly be called suitable for %ra!\n"
"\n"
"\"How could you have strayed from the %a path?  Go from here, and come\n"
"back only when you have purified yourself.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:225
msgid "[%pC, a mere %r is too inexperienced.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:227
msgid ""
"\"%p, you are yet too inexperienced to undertake such a demanding\n"
"quest.  A mere %r could not possibly face the rigors demanded and\n"
"survive.  Go forth, and come here again when your adventures have further\n"
"taught you.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:257
msgid "[You arrive at %H, but all is not well.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:259
msgid ""
"You are suddenly in familiar surroundings.  The buildings in the distance\n"
"seem to be those of your old alma mater, but something is wrong.  It feels\n"
"as if there has been a riot recently, or %H has\n"
"been under siege.\n"
"\n"
"All of the windows are boarded up, and there are objects scattered around\n"
"the entrance.\n"
"\n"
"Strange forbidding shapes seem to be moving in the distance."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:270 dat/quest.lua:2505 dat/quest.lua:2945
msgid "You have returned to %ns lair."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:273
msgid "[This strange feeling must be the presence of %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:275
msgid ""
"A strange feeling washes over you, and you think back to things you\n"
"learned during the many lectures of %l.\n"
"\n"
"You realize the feeling must be the presence of %o."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:281
msgid "The familiar presence of %o is in the ether."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:284
msgid "[The power of %o flows through your body!  You must return it to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:286
msgid ""
"The power of %o flows through your body!  You feel\n"
"as if you could now take on the Wizard of Yendor himself and win, but\n"
"you know you must return %o to %l."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:305
msgid ""
"[Take the Amulet to the Astral Plane and sacrifice it at the altar of %d.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:307
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations, %p.  I wondered if anyone could prevail against\n"
"the Wizard and the minions of Moloch.  Now, you must embark on one\n"
"final adventure.\n"
"\n"
"\"Take the Amulet, and find your way onto the Astral Plane.\n"
"There you must find the altar of %d and sacrifice the\n"
"Amulet on that altar to fulfill your destiny.\n"
"\n"
"\"Remember, your path now should always be upwards.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:318
msgid "The body of %n dissipates in a cloud of noxious fumes."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:323
msgid ""
"\"Finally you have returned, %p.  You were always\n"
"my most promising student.  Allow me to see if you are ready for the\n"
"most difficult task of your career.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:330
msgid ""
"\"%p, you have failed us.  All of my careful training has been in\n"
"vain.  Begone!  Your tenure at this college has been revoked!\n"
"\n"
"\"You are a disgrace to the profession!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:336
msgid ""
"\"Again, %p, you stand before me.\n"
"Let me see if you have gained experience in the interim.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:340
msgid ""
"\"Once more, %p, you have returned from the field.\n"
"Are you finally ready for the task that must be accomplished?\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:344
msgid "[This foreboding edifice must hide the entrance to %i.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:346
msgid ""
"A plain opens before you.  Beyond the plain lies a foreboding edifice.\n"
"\n"
"You have the feeling that you will soon find the entrance to\n"
"%i."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:352
msgid "Once again, you are near the entrance to %i."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:357
msgid ""
"\"So, %p, you think that you can succeed in recovering\n"
"%o, when your teacher, %l, has already failed.\n"
"\n"
"\"Come, try your best!  I shall destroy you, and gnaw on your bones.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:365
msgid ""
"\"Again you try to best me, eh %p?  Well, you shall fail again.\n"
"\n"
"\"You shall never recover %o.\n"
"\n"
"\"I shall bear your soul to the Plane of Origins for my master's pleasure.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:375
msgid ""
"\"I shall have %o from you, %p, then feast\n"
"upon your entrails!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:379 dat/quest.lua:2384 dat/quest.lua:2620 dat/quest.lua:3054
msgid "Once again, you are back at %H."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:382
msgid "[%lC instructs you to guard %o from now on.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:384
msgid ""
"%lC touches %o briefly, gazes into it,\n"
"then smiles at you and says:\n"
"\n"
"\"Well done, %p.  You have defeated %n and\n"
"recovered %o.  But I fear that it shall never be safe\n"
"here.\n"
"\n"
"Please take %o with you.  You, %p, can\n"
"guard it now far better than I.\n"
"\n"
"May the blessings of %d follow you and guard you.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:399 dat/quest.lua:2848
msgid ""
"\"Careful, %p!  %oC might break, and that would be\n"
"a tragic loss.  You are its keeper now, and the time has come to\n"
"resume your search for the Amulet.  %Z await your\n"
"return through the magic portal that brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:405 dat/quest.lua:3079
msgid ""
"You are back at %H.\n"
"You have an odd feeling this may be the last time you ever come here."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:411
msgid ""
"\"Welcome back, %p.  Have you progressed with your quest to\n"
"regain the Amulet of Yendor for %d?\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:419
msgid ""
"\"The world is in great need of your assistance, %p.\n"
"\n"
"\"About six months ago, I learned that a mysterious sorcerer, known\n"
"as %n, had begun to gather a large group of cutthroats and brigands\n"
"about %ni.\n"
"\n"
"\"At about the same time, these people you once rode with `liberated' a\n"
"potent magical talisman, %o, from a Turanian caravan.\n"
"\n"
"\"%nC and %nj Black Horde swept down upon %i and defeated\n"
"the people there, driving them out into the desert.  He has taken\n"
"%o, and seeks to bend it to %nj will.  I detected the\n"
"subtle changes in the currents of fate, and joined these people.\n"
"Then I sent forth a summons for you.\n"
"\n"
"\"If %n can bend %o to %nj will, he will become\n"
"almost indestructible.  He will then be able to enslave the minds of\n"
"men across the world.  You are the only hope.  The gods smile upon you,\n"
"and with %d behind you, you alone can defeat %n.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must go to %i.  From there, you can track down\n"
"%n, defeat %ni, and return %o to us.  Only\n"
"then will the world be safe.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:446
msgid ""
"\"%pC!  You have wandered from the path of the %a!\n"
"If you attempt to overcome %n in this state, he will surely\n"
"enslave your soul.  Your only hope, and ours, lies in your purification.\n"
"Go forth, and return when you feel ready.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:454
msgid ""
"\"%p, I fear that you are as yet too inexperienced to face\n"
"%n.  Only %Ra with the help of %d could ever hope to\n"
"defeat %ni.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:483
msgid "[You reach the vicinity of %H, but sense evil magic nearby.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:485
msgid ""
"Warily you scan your surroundings, all of your senses alert for signs\n"
"of possible danger.  Off in the distance, you can %x the familiar shapes\n"
"of %H.\n"
"\n"
"But why, you think, should %l be there?\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, the hairs on your neck stand on end as you detect the aura of\n"
"evil magic in the air.\n"
"\n"
"Without thought, you ready your weapon, and mutter under your breath:\n"
"\n"
"    \"By %d, there will be blood spilt today.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:499
msgid "[This is surely the lair of %n.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:501
msgid ""
"The hairs on the nape of your neck lift as you sense an energy in the\n"
"very air around you.  You fight down a primordial panic that seeks to\n"
"make you turn and run.  This is surely the lair of %n."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:506
msgid ""
"Yet again you feel the air around you heavy with malevolent magical energy."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:509
msgid "[You feel the power of %o flowing through your hands.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:511
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, you feel the power of it\n"
"flowing through your hands.  It seems to be in two or more places\n"
"at once, even though you are holding it."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:532
msgid ""
"\"This is wondrous, %p.  I feared that you could not possibly\n"
"succeed in your quest, but here you are in possession of the Amulet\n"
"of Yendor!\n"
"\n"
"\"I have studied the texts of the magi constantly since you left.  In\n"
"the Book of Skelos, I found this:\n"
"\n"
"    %d will cause a child to be sent into the world.  This child is to\n"
"    be made strong by trial of battle and magic, for %d has willed it so.\n"
"    It is said that the child of %d will recover the Amulet of Yendor\n"
"    that was stolen from the Creator at the beginning of time.\n"
"\n"
"\"As you now possess the amulet, %p, I suspect that the Book\n"
"speaks of you.\n"
"\n"
"    The child of %d will take the Amulet, and travel to the Astral\n"
"    Plane, where the Great Temple of %d is to be found.  The Amulet\n"
"    will be sacrificed to %d, there on %dJ altar.  Then the child will\n"
"    stand by %d as champion of all %cP for eternity.\n"
"\n"
"\"This is all I know, %p.  I hope it will help you.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:555
msgid "[%nC curses you, but you feel the overpowering aura of magic fading.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:557
msgid ""
"%nC falls to the ground, and utters a last curse at you.  Then %nj\n"
"body fades slowly, seemingly dispersing into the air around you.  You\n"
"slowly become aware that the overpowering aura of magic in the air has\n"
"begun to fade."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:565
msgid ""
"\"Ah, %p.  You have returned at last.  The world is in dire\n"
"need of your help.  There is a great quest you must undertake.\n"
"\n"
"\"But first, I must see if you are ready to take on such a challenge.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:573
msgid ""
"\"Pah!  You have betrayed the gods, %p.  You will never attain\n"
"the glory which you aspire to.  Your failure to follow the true path has\n"
"closed this future to you.\n"
"\n"
"\"I will protect these people as best I can, but soon %n will overcome\n"
"me and destroy all who once called you %s.  Now begone!\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:587
msgid "[You have located %i.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:589
msgid ""
"The scent of water comes to you in the desert breeze.  You know that\n"
"you have located %i."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:593
msgid "Yet again you have a chance to infiltrate %i."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:596
msgid "[%nC boasts that %nh has slain many.  \\"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:598
msgid ""
"\"So.  This is what that second rate sorcerer %l sends to do %lj bidding.\n"
"I have slain many before you.  You shall give me little sport.\n"
"\n"
"\"Prepare to die, %c.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:610
msgid ""
"\"I shall have %o back, you pitiful excuse for %ca.\n"
"And your life as well.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:614
msgid ""
"Once again, you near %H.  You know that %l\n"
"will be waiting."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:618
msgid "[%lC tells you to guard %o, and to return when you have triumphed.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:620
msgid ""
"When %l sees %o, he smiles, and says:\n"
"\n"
"    Well done, %p.  You have saved the world from certain doom.\n"
"    What, now, should be done with %o?\n"
"\n"
"    These people, brave as they are, cannot hope to guard it from\n"
"    other sorcerers who will detect it, as surely as %n did.\n"
"\n"
"    Take %o with you, %p.  It will guard you in\n"
"    your adventures, and you can best guard it.  You embark on a\n"
"    quest far greater than you realize.\n"
"\n"
"    Remember me, %p, and return when you have triumphed.  I\n"
"    will tell you then of what you must do.  You will understand when the\n"
"    time comes."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:639
msgid ""
"%l gazes reverently at %o, then back at you.\n"
"\n"
"\"You are its keeper now, and the time has come to resume your search\n"
"for the Amulet.  %Z await your return through the\n"
"magic portal which brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:646
msgid ""
"Again, and you think possibly for the last time, you approach\n"
"%H."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:655
msgid "[Find and defeat %n, recover %o, and return with it.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:657
msgid ""
"\"You are indeed ready now, %p.  I shall tell you a tale of\n"
"great suffering among your people:\n"
"\n"
"\"Shortly after you left on your vision quest, the caves were invaded by\n"
"the creatures sent against us by %n.\n"
"\n"
"\"She, herself, could not attack us due to her great size, but her minions\n"
"have harassed us ever since.  In the first attacks, many died, and the\n"
"minions of %n managed to steal %o.\n"
"They took it to %i and there, none of our\n"
"%g warriors have been able to go.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must find %i, and within it wrest\n"
"%o from %n.  She guards it as\n"
"jealously as she guards all treasures she attains.  But with it,\n"
"we can make our caves safe once more.\n"
"\n"
"\"Please, %p, recover %o for us, and return it here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:679
msgid ""
"\"%pC!  You have deviated from my teachings.  You no longer follow\n"
"the path of the %a as you should.  I banish you from these caves, to\n"
"go forth and purify yourself.  Then, you might be able to accomplish this\n"
"quest.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:687
msgid ""
"\"Alas, %p, you are as yet too inexperienced to embark upon such\n"
"a difficult quest as that I propose to give you.\n"
"\n"
"\"%rA could not possibly survive the rigors demanded to find\n"
"%i, never mind to confront %n herself.\n"
"\n"
"\"Adventure some more, and you will learn the skills you will require.\n"
"%d decrees it.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:721
msgid "[You arrive back at %H, but something is wrong here.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:723
msgid ""
"You descend through a barely familiar stairwell that you remember\n"
"%l showing you when you embarked upon your vision quest.\n"
"\n"
"You arrive back at %H, but something seems\n"
"wrong here.  The usual smoke and glowing light of the fires of the\n"
"outer caves are absent, and an uneasy quiet fills the damp air."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:731
msgid "[You enter a large cavern.  %nC is present.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:733
msgid ""
"You find yourself in a large cavern, with neatly polished walls, that\n"
"nevertheless show signs of being scorched by fire.\n"
"\n"
"Bones litter the floor, and there are objects scattered everywhere.\n"
"The air is close with the stench of sulphurous fumes.\n"
"\n"
"%nC is clearly visible, but %nh seems to be asleep."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:742
msgid "Once again, you find yourself in the lair of %n."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:745
msgid "[%oC fills you with a feeling of power.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:747
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o it seems heavy at first, but as you\n"
"hold it strength flows into your arms.\n"
"\n"
"You suddenly feel full of power, as if nothing could possibly stand\n"
"in your path."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:770
msgid ""
"\"You have been successful, I see, %p.\n"
"\n"
"\"Now that the Amulet of Yendor is yours, here is what you must do:\n"
"\n"
"\"Journey upwards to the open air.  The Amulet you carry will then\n"
"take you into the Astral Planes, where the Great Temple of %d\n"
"casts its influence throughout our world.\n"
"\n"
"\"Sacrifice the Amulet on the altar.  Thus shall %d become supreme!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:781
msgid ""
"%nC sinks to the ground, her heads flailing about.\n"
"As she dies, a cloud of noxious fumes billows about her."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:787
msgid ""
"\"You have returned from your vision quest, %p.  Thank %d.\n"
"\n"
"\"We are in dire need of your help, my %S.\n"
"\n"
"\"But first, I must see if you are yet capable of the quest I would\n"
"ask you to undertake.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:797
msgid ""
"\"%pC!  You have sealed our fate.  You seem unable to reform yourself,\n"
"so I must select another to take your place.\n"
"\n"
"\"Begone from %H!  You have betrayed us by choosing\n"
"the path of the %C over the true path of the %L.\n"
"\n"
"\"You no longer live in our eyes.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:812
msgid "[You %x many large claw marks, smell carrion, and notice bones.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:814
msgid ""
"You %x many large claw marks on the ground.  The tunnels ahead\n"
"of you are larger than most of those in any cave complex you have\n"
"ever been in before.\n"
"\n"
"Your nose detects the smell of carrion from within, and bones litter\n"
"the sides of the tunnels."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:822
msgid "Once again, you approach %i."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:825
msgid "[%nC threatens to eat you.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:827
msgid ""
"\"So, follower of %l, you seek to invade the lair of\n"
"%n.  Only my meals are allowed down here.  Prepare\n"
"to be eaten!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:832
msgid ""
"\"So, again you face me, %c.  No one has ever before escaped me.\n"
"Now I shall kill you.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:842
msgid "Once again, you arrive back at %H."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:847
msgid ""
"%lC glimpses %o in your possession.\n"
"He smiles and says:\n"
"\n"
"    You have done it!  We are saved.  But I fear that %o\n"
"    will always be a target for %C forces who will want it for their\n"
"    own.\n"
"\n"
"    To prevent further trouble, I would like you, %p,\n"
"    to take %o away with you.  It will help you as you\n"
"    quest for the Amulet of Yendor."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:861
msgid ""
"%l grasps %o proudly for a moment, then looks at you.\n"
"\n"
"\"You are its keeper now, and the time has come to resume your search\n"
"for the Amulet.  %Z await your return through the\n"
"magic portal which brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:868
msgid ""
"For some reason, you think that this may be the last time you will\n"
"enter %H."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:872
msgid ""
"\"%pC!  Welcome back.\n"
"How goes your quest to recover the Amulet for %d?\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:878
msgid "[Travel to %i on your way to recover %o from %n.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:880
msgid ""
"For the first time, you sense a smile on %ls face.\n"
"\n"
"    \"You have indeed learned as much as we can teach you in preparation\n"
"    for this task.  Let me tell you what I know of the symptoms and hope\n"
"    that you can provide a cure.\n"
"\n"
"    \"A short while ago, the dreaded %nt was fooled by the gods\n"
"    into thinking that %nh could use %o to find a\n"
"    cure for old age.  Think of it, eternal youth!  But %nj good\n"
"    health is accomplished by drawing the health from those around %ni.\n"
"\n"
"    \"He has exhausted %nj own supply of healthy people and now %nh seeks "
"to\n"
"    extend %nj influence into our world.  You must recover from %ni\n"
"    %o and break the spell.\n"
"\n"
"    \"You must travel into the swamps to %i, and from there\n"
"    follow the trail to %ns island lair.  Be careful.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:899
msgid "[Return when you are more %a.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:901
msgid ""
"\"You have learned much of the remedies that benefit, but you must also\n"
"know which physic for which ail.  That is why %ds teachings are a\n"
"part of your training.\n"
"\n"
"\"Return to us when you have healed thyself.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:908
msgid "[You are too inexperienced.  Return when you are %Ra.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:910
msgid ""
"\"Alas, %p, you are yet too inexperienced to deal with the rigors\n"
"of such a task.  You must be able to draw on the knowledge of botany,\n"
"alchemy and veterinary practices before I can send you on this quest \n"
"with good conscience.\n"
"\n"
"\"Return when you wear %Ra's caduceus.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:942
msgid "[You arrive back at %H and must find %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:944
msgid ""
"What sorcery has brought you back to %H?  The smell\n"
"of fresh funeral pyres tells you that something is amiss with the healing\n"
"powers that used to practice here.\n"
"\n"
"No rhizotomists are tending the materia medica gardens, and where are the\n"
"common folk who used to come for the cures?\n"
"\n"
"You know that you must quickly make your way to the collegium, and\n"
"%ls iatreion, and find out what has happened in your absence."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:955
msgid "[You have reached the lair of %n.  Take %o away from %ni.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:957
msgid ""
"You stand within sight of the infamous Isle of %n.  Even\n"
"the words of %l had not prepared you for this.\n"
"\n"
"Steeling yourself against the wails of the ill that pierce your ears,\n"
"you hurry on your task.  Maybe with %o you can\n"
"heal them on your return, but not now."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:965
msgid "Once again, you %x the Isle of %n in the distance."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:968
msgid "[You feel the healing power of %o and should return it to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:970
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, you feel its healing begin to\n"
"warm your soul.  You curse Zeus for taking it from its rightful owner,\n"
"but at least you hope that %l can put it to good use once\n"
"again."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:992
msgid ""
"\"Ah, you have recovered the Amulet, %p.  Well done!\n"
"\n"
"\"Now, you should know that you must travel through the Elemental Planes\n"
"to the Astral, and there return the Amulet to %d.  Go forth and\n"
"may our prayers be as a wind upon your back.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:999 dat/quest.lua:1234 dat/quest.lua:1885 dat/quest.lua:2990
msgid "[%nC curses you as %nh dies.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1001
msgid ""
"The battered body of %n slumps to the ground and gasps\n"
"out one last curse:\n"
"\n"
"    \"You have defeated me, %p, but I shall have my revenge.\n"
"    How, I shall not say, but this curse shall be like a cancer\n"
"    on you.\"\n"
"\n"
"With that %n dies."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1011
msgid "[%l is weak from the struggle with %n.  %lH wants to examine you.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1013
msgid ""
"Feebly, %l raises %lj head to look at you.\n"
"\n"
"\"It is good to see you again, %p.  I see the concern in your\n"
"eyes, but do not worry for me.  I am not ready for Hades yet.  We have\n"
"exhausted much of our healing powers holding off %n.\n"
"I need your fresh strength to carry on our work.\n"
"\n"
"\"Come closer and let me lay hands on you, and determine if you have\n"
"the skills necessary to accomplish this mission.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1024
msgid "[You are a failure as a healer.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1026
msgid ""
"\"You have failed us, %p.  You are a quack!  A charlatan!\n"
"\n"
"\"Hades will be happy to hear that you are once again practicing your\n"
"arts on the unsuspecting.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1032
msgid ""
"\"Again you return to me, %p.  I sense that each trip back\n"
"the pleurisy and maladies of our land begin to infect you.  Let us\n"
"hope and pray to %d that you become ready for your task before\n"
"you fall victim to the bad humors.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1038
msgid ""
"\"Chiron has fallen, Hermes has fallen, what else must I tell you to\n"
"impress upon you the importance of your mission!  I hope that you\n"
"have come prepared this time.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1043
msgid "[You have reached %i but all is not well.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1045
msgid ""
"You stand before the entrance to %i.  Strange\n"
"scratching noises come from within the building.\n"
"\n"
"The swampy ground around you seems to stink with disease."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1051
msgid "Once again you stand at the entrance to %i."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1056
msgid ""
"\"They have made a mistake in sending you, %p.\n"
"\n"
"\"When I add your youth to mine, it will just make it easier for me\n"
"to defeat %l.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1068
msgid ""
"\"I'll have %o back from you, %r.  You are\n"
"not going to live to escape this place.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1072
msgid ""
"After your last experience you expected to be here, but you certainly\n"
"did not expect to see things so much worse.  This time you must succeed."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1076
msgid ""
"[%l touches %o and tells %lj %gP to do so too, then tells you to take it "
"with you.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1078
msgid ""
"As soon as %l sees %o %lh summons %lj\n"
"%gP.\n"
"\n"
"Gently, %l reaches out and touches %o.\n"
"He instructs each of the assembled to do the same.  When everyone\n"
"has finished %lh speaks to you.\n"
"\n"
"    \"Now that we have been replenished we can defeat this plague.  You "
"must\n"
"    take %o with you and replenish the worlds you have\n"
"    been called upon to travel next.  I wish you could ride Chiron to the\n"
"    end of your journey, but I need him to help me spread the cure.  Go\n"
"    now and continue your journey.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1092
msgid "[%l tells you to keep %o and return to %Z to search for the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1094
msgid ""
"%l cautiously handles %o while watching you.\n"
"\n"
"\"You are its keeper now, and the time has come to resume your search\n"
"for the Amulet.  %Z await your return through the\n"
"magic portal which brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1101
msgid ""
"Again, you %x %H in the distance.\n"
"\n"
"The smell of death and disease permeates the air.  You do not have\n"
"to be %Ra to know that %n is on the verge of victory."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1107
msgid ""
"\"You have again returned to us, %p.  We have done well in your\n"
"absence, yes?  How fare you upon your quest for the Amulet?\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1113
msgid "[Pass through %i to reach %n.  Destroy %ni and return with %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1115
msgid ""
"\"Ah, %p.  Thou art truly ready, as no %c before thee hath\n"
"been.  Hear now Our words:\n"
"\n"
"\"As thou noticed as thou approached %H, a great battle hath\n"
"been fought recently in these fields.  Know thou that Merlin himself\n"
"came to aid Us here as We battled the foul %n.  In the midst of that\n"
"battle, %n struck Merlin a great blow, felling him.  Then, as Our\n"
"forces were pressed back, %n stole %o.\n"
"\n"
"\"We eventually turned the tide, but lost many %cP in doing so.\n"
"Merlin was taken off by his apprentice, but hath not recovered.  We have\n"
"been told that so long as %n possesseth %o,\n"
"Merlin will not regain his health.\n"
"\n"
"\"We hereby charge thee with this most important of duties:\n"
"\n"
"\"Go forth from this place, to the fens, and there thou wilt find\n"
"%i.  From there, thou must track down %n.  Destroy the\n"
"beast, and return to Us %o.  Only then can\n"
"We restore Merlin to health.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1137
msgid "[Go and do penance.  Return when you are truly %a.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1139
msgid ""
"\"Thou dishonourest Us, %p!  Thou hast strayed from the path of\n"
"chivalry! Go from Our presence and do penance.  Only when thou art again\n"
"pure mayst thou return hence.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1144
msgid "[You are not prepared to face %n.  Return when you are %Ra.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1146
msgid ""
"\"Verily, %p, thou hast done well.  That thou hast survived thus\n"
"far is a credit to thy valor, but thou art yet unprepared for\n"
"the demands required as Our Champion.  %rA, no matter how\n"
"pure, could never hope to defeat the foul %n.\n"
"\n"
"\"Journey forth from this place, and hone thy skills.  Return to\n"
"Our presence when thou hast attained the noble title of %R.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1179
msgid "[Signs of battle include long gouges in the walls of %H.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1181
msgid ""
"You materialize in the shadows of %H.  Immediately, you notice\n"
"that something is wrong.  The fields around the castle are trampled and\n"
"withered, as if some great battle has been recently fought.\n"
"\n"
"Exploring further, you %x long gouges in the walls of %H.\n"
"You know of only one creature that makes those kinds of marks..."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1189
msgid "[You %x the entrance to a cavern inside a hill.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1191
msgid ""
"As you exit the swamps, you %x before you a huge, gaping hole in the\n"
"side of a hill.  From within, you smell the foul stench of carrion.\n"
"\n"
"The pools on either side of the entrance are fouled with blood, and\n"
"pieces of rusted metal and broken weapons show above the surface."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1198
msgid "Again, you stand at the entrance to %ns lair."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1201
msgid "[You feel the magic of %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1203
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, you feel its protective fields\n"
"form around your body.  You also feel a faint stirring in your mind, as\n"
"if you are in two places at once, and in the second, you are waking from\n"
"a long sleep."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1223 dat/quest.lua:1435
msgid "[Take the Amulet to the Astral Plane and deliver it to %d.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1225
msgid ""
"\"Thou hast succeeded, We see, %p!  Now thou art commanded to take\n"
"the Amulet to be sacrificed to %d in the Plane of the Astral.\n"
"\n"
"\"Merlin hath counseled Us that thou must travel always upwards through\n"
"the Planes of the Elements, to achieve this goal.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go with %d, %p.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1236
msgid ""
"As %n sinks to the ground, blood gushing from %nj open mouth, %nh\n"
"defiantly curses you and %l:\n"
"\n"
"    \"Thou hast not won yet, %r.  By the gods, I shall return\n"
"    and dog thy steps to the grave!\"\n"
"\n"
"%nJ tail flailing madly, %n tries to crawl towards you, but slumps\n"
"to the ground and dies in a pool of %nj own blood."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1246
msgid "[%lC checks whether you are ready for a great undertaking.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1248
msgid ""
"\"Ah, %p.  We see thou hast received Our summons.\n"
"We are in dire need of thy prowess.  But first, We must needs\n"
"decide if thou art ready for this great undertaking.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1253
msgid "[You are a disgrace as %ca.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1255
msgid ""
"\"Thou disgracest this noble court with thine impure presence.  We have "
"been\n"
"lenient with thee, but no more.  Thy name shall be spoken no more.  We\n"
"hereby strip thee of thy title, thy lands, and thy standing as %ca.\n"
"Begone from Our sight!\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1267
msgid "[You have reached %i and can %x a shrine.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1269
msgid ""
"You stand at the foot of %i.  Atop, you can %x a shrine.\n"
"Strange energies seem to be focused here, and the hair on the back of\n"
"your neck stands on end."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1274
msgid "Again, you stand at the foot of %i."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1277
msgid "[%nC taunts you and issues a threat against %H.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1279
msgid ""
"\"Hah!  Another puny %c seeks death.  I shall dine well tonight,\n"
"then tomorrow, %H shall fall!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1289
msgid ""
"\"So, thou darest touch MY property!  I shall have that bauble back,\n"
"puny %r.  Thou wilt die in agony!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1293
msgid "Once again you stand in the shadows of %H."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1296
msgid "[%oC is yours now.  It will aid in your search for the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1298
msgid ""
"As you approach %l, %lh beams at you and says:\n"
"\n"
"    \"Well done!  Thou art truly the Champion of %H.  We\n"
"    have received word that Merlin is recovering, and shall soon\n"
"    rejoin Us.\n"
"\n"
"    \"He hath instructed Us that thou art now to be the guardian of\n"
"    %o.  He feeleth that thou mayst have need of\n"
"    its powers in thine adventures.  It is Our wish that thou keepest\n"
"    %o with thee as thou searchest for the fabled\n"
"    Amulet of Yendor.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1311
msgid "[You are the keeper of %o.  Return to %Z and find the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1313
msgid ""
"\"Careful, %p!  %oC might break, and that would\n"
"be a tragic loss.  Thou art its keeper now, and the time hath come\n"
"to resume thy search for the Amulet.  %Z await thy\n"
"return through the magic portal that brought thee here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1319
msgid ""
"Again, you stand before %H.  You vaguely sense that this\n"
"may be the last time you stand before %l."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1328
msgid "[Find %i, then continue to %ns lair.  Defeat %ni and return with %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1330
msgid ""
"\"Yes, %p.  You are truly ready now.  Attend to me and I shall\n"
"tell you of what has transpired:\n"
"\n"
"\"During one of the Great Meditations a short time ago, %n and\n"
"a legion of elementals invaded %H.  Many %gP\n"
"were killed, including the one bearing %o.\n"
"\n"
"Now, there are barely enough %gP left to keep the elementals\n"
"at bay.\n"
"\n"
"\"We need you to find %i, then, from there,\n"
"travel to %ns lair.  If you can manage to defeat %n and\n"
"return %o here, we can then drive off the legions\n"
"of elementals that slay our students.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go with %d as your guide, %p.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1348
msgid "[You must atone.  Come back when you are worthy of %d.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1350 dat/quest.lua:1563
msgid ""
"\"This is terrible, %p.  You have deviated from the true path!\n"
"You know that %d requires the most strident devotion of this\n"
"order.  The %shood must stand for utmost piety.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go from here, atone for your sins against %d.  Return only when\n"
"you have purified yourself.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1358
msgid "[You are not ready to face %n.  Come back when you are %Ra.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1360
msgid ""
"\"Alas, %p, it is not yet to be.  A mere %r could never\n"
"withstand the might of %n.  Go forth, again into the world, and\n"
"return when you have attained the post of %R.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1389
msgid "[You have reached %H but something is wrong.  %lC needs your aid.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1391
msgid ""
"You find yourself standing in sight of %H.\n"
"Something is obviously wrong here.  Strange shapes lumber around\n"
"outside %H!\n"
"\n"
"You realize that %l needs your assistance!"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1398
msgid "[You are surrounded by brimstone, lava, and elementals.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1400
msgid ""
"The stench of brimstone is all about you, and the elementals close in\n"
"from all sides!\n"
"\n"
"Ahead, there is a small clearing amidst the bubbling pits of lava..."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1406 dat/quest.lua:1620
msgid "Again, you have invaded %ns domain."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1409
msgid "[You feel the essence of %d and realize that you should take %o to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1411
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, you feel the essence of\n"
"%d fill your soul.  You know now why %n stole %oi from\n"
"%H, for with %oi, %ca of %d could\n"
"easily defeat his plans.\n"
"\n"
"You sense a message from %d.  Though not verbal, you\n"
"get the impression that you must return to %l as soon\n"
"as possible."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1437
msgid ""
"\"You have prevailed, %p!  %d is surely with you.  Now,\n"
"you must take the Amulet, and sacrifice it on %ds altar on\n"
"the Astral Plane.  I suspect that I shall never see you again in this\n"
"life, but I hope to at %ds feet.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1443
msgid "[As %n dies, %nh threatens to return.]"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1453
msgid "[%lC checks whether you are ready for the great challenge.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1455 dat/quest.lua:1674
msgid ""
"\"Ah, %p, my %S.  You have returned to us at last.\n"
"A great blow has befallen our order; perhaps you can help us.\n"
"First, however, I must determine if you are prepared for this\n"
"great challenge.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1461
msgid "[You are a heretic and have failed utterly.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1463 dat/quest.lua:1682
msgid ""
"\"You are a heretic, %p!  How can you, %ra, deviate so from the\n"
"teachings of %d?  Begone from this temple.  You are no longer\n"
"%sa to this order.  We will pray to %d for other assistance,\n"
"as you have failed us utterly.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1475
msgid "[You have reached %i.  %nC lurks further ahead.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1477
msgid ""
"You remember the descriptions of %i, given\n"
"to you by %l.  It is ahead that you will find\n"
"%n's trail."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1482 dat/quest.lua:1704
msgid "Again, you stand before %i."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1485
msgid "[You are no %g.  You shall never regain %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1487
msgid ""
"\"Ah, so %l has sent another %g to retrieve\n"
"%o.\n"
"\n"
"\"No, I see you are no %g.  Perhaps I shall have some fun today\n"
"after all.  Prepare to die, %r!  You shall never regain\n"
"%o.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1504 dat/quest.lua:1726 dat/quest.lua:1955
msgid "Once again, you stand before %H."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1507
msgid "[Keep %o.  %oH will help you recover the Amulet of Yendor.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1509
msgid ""
"\"You have returned, %p.  And with %o, I see.\n"
"Congratulations.\n"
"\n"
"\"I have been in meditation, and have received direction from\n"
"a minion of %d.  %d commands that you retain\n"
"%o.  With %oi, you must recover the Amulet\n"
"of Yendor.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go forth, and let %d guide your steps.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1520
msgid "[Keep %o and return to %Z to search for the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1522
msgid ""
"%lC studies %o for a moment,\n"
"then returns his gaze to you.\n"
"\n"
"\"%oC must remain with you.  Use %oi\n"
"as you resume your search for the Amulet.\n"
"%Z await your return through the magic portal\n"
"that brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1531
msgid ""
"Again you face %H.  Your intuition hints that this\n"
"may be the final time you come here."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1540
msgid "[%nC invaded %H and captured %o.  Defeat %ni and retrieve %oh.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1542
msgid ""
"\"Yes, %p.  You are truly ready now.  Attend to me and I shall\n"
"tell you of what has transpired:\n"
"\n"
"\"At one of the Great Festivals a short time ago, %n and a legion\n"
"of undead invaded %H.  Many %gP were killed, including\n"
"the one carrying %o.\n"
"\n"
"\"As a final act of vengefulness, %n desecrated the altar here.\n"
"Without it, we could not mount a counter-attack.  Now, there are\n"
"barely enough %gP left to keep the undead at bay.\n"
"\n"
"\"We need you to find %i, then, from there, travel\n"
"to %ns lair.  If you can manage to defeat %n and return\n"
"%o here, we can then drive off the legions of\n"
"undead that befoul the land.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go with %d as your guide, %p.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1561
msgid ""
"[You have deviated from the path.  Return when you have purified yourself.]"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1571
msgid "[%rA cannot withstand %n.  Come back when you are %Ra.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1573
msgid ""
"\"Alas, %p, it is not yet to be.  A mere %r could never\n"
"withstand the might of %n.  Go forth, again into the world, and return\n"
"when you have attained the post of %R.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1602
msgid "[You are at %H; the doors are closed.  %lC needs your help!]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1604
msgid ""
"You find yourself standing in sight of %H.  Something\n"
"is obviously wrong here.  The doors to %H, which usually\n"
"stand open, are closed.  Strange human shapes shamble around\n"
"outside.\n"
"\n"
"You realize that %l needs your assistance!"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1612
msgid ""
"[The stench of brimstone surrounds you, the shrieks and moans are endless.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1614
msgid ""
"The stench of brimstone is all about you, and the shrieks and moans\n"
"of tortured souls assault your psyche.\n"
"\n"
"Ahead, there is a small clearing amidst the bubbling pits of lava..."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1623
msgid "[You feel %d as you pick up %o; return %oh to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1625
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, you feel the essence of\n"
"%d fill your soul.  You know now why %n stole it from\n"
"%H, for with it, %ca of %d could\n"
"easily defeat his plans.\n"
"\n"
"You sense a message from %d.  Though not verbal, you\n"
"get the impression that you must return to %l as soon\n"
"as possible."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1649
msgid "[Take the Amulet to the Astral Plane and offer it on %ds altar.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1651
msgid ""
"\"You have prevailed, %p!  %d is surely with you.  Now,\n"
"you must take the amulet, and sacrifice it on %ds altar on\n"
"the Astral Plane.  I suspect that I shall never see you again in this\n"
"life, but I hope to at %ds feet.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1657
msgid "[%nC dies.  Moloch is aware of you and angry at %n.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1659
msgid ""
"You feel a wrenching shift in the ether as %ns body dissolves\n"
"into a cloud of noxious gas.\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, a voice booms out:\n"
"\n"
"    \"Thou hast defeated the least of my minions, %r.\n"
"    Know now that Moloch is aware of thy presence.\n"
"    As for thee, %n, I shall deal with thy failure\n"
"    at my leisure.\"\n"
"\n"
"You then hear the voice of %n, screaming in terror..."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1672
msgid "[You have returned and we need your help.  Are you ready?]"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1680
msgid "[You are a heretic who has deviated from the teachings of %d.]"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1694
msgid "[You have found %i.  The trail to %n lies ahead.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1696
msgid ""
"You stand facing a large graveyard.  The sky above is filled with clouds\n"
"that seem to get thicker closer to the center.  You sense the presence of\n"
"undead in larger numbers than you have ever encountered before.\n"
"\n"
"You remember the descriptions of %i, given to you by\n"
"%l.  It is ahead that you will find %ns trail."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1707
msgid "[%lC has sent you, but you are no %gC.  I shall destroy you.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1709
msgid ""
"\"Ah, so %l has sent another %gC to retrieve\n"
"%o.\n"
"\n"
"\"No, I see you are no %gC.  Perhaps I shall have some fun today\n"
"after all.  Prepare to die, %r!  You shall never regain\n"
"%o.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1729
msgid "[Congratulations, %p.  Keep %o; go and recover the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1731
msgid ""
"\"You have returned, %p.  And with %o, I see.\n"
"Congratulations.\n"
"\n"
"\"I have been in meditation, and have received direction from\n"
"a minion of %d.  %d commands that you retain\n"
"%o.  With it, you must recover the Amulet\n"
"of Yendor.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go forth, and let %d guide your steps.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1742
msgid "[%oC is yours now.  Return to %Z and find the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1744
msgid ""
"%lC reiterates that %o is yours now.\n"
"\n"
"\"The time has come to resume your search for the Amulet.\n"
"%Z await your return through the magic portal\n"
"that brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1751
msgid ""
"Again you face %H.  Your intuition hints that this may be\n"
"the final time you come here."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1760
msgid "[%nC has stolen %o.  Infiltrate %i and retrieve %oh for us.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1762
msgid ""
"\"You are indeed ready, %p.  I shall tell you what has transpired,\n"
"and why we so desperately need your help:\n"
"\n"
"\"A short time ago, the mountain centaurs to the east invaded\n"
"and enslaved the plains centaurs in this area.  The local\n"
"leader is now only a figurehead, and serves %n.\n"
"\n"
"\"During our last gathering of worship here, we were beset by hordes of\n"
"hostile centaurs, as you witnessed.  In the first onslaught a group,\n"
"headed by %n %niself, managed to breach the grove and steal\n"
"%o.\n"
"\n"
"\"Since then, we have been besieged.  We do not know how much longer\n"
"we will be able to maintain our magical barriers.\n"
"\n"
"\"If we are to survive, you, %p, must infiltrate\n"
"%i.  There, you will find a pathway down, to the\n"
"underground cavern of %n.  He has always coveted\n"
"%o, and will surely keep it.\n"
"\n"
"\"Recover %o for us, %p!  Only then will %d be safe.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1785
msgid ""
"[You are not sufficiently %a.  Come back when you have purified yourself.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1787
msgid ""
"\"You have strayed, %p!  You know that %d requires that\n"
"we maintain a pure devotion to things %a!\n"
"\n"
"\"You must go from us.  Return when you have purified yourself.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1793
msgid "[You are too inexperienced.  Come back when you are %Ra.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1795
msgid ""
"\"%p, you are yet too inexperienced to withstand the demands of that\n"
"which we need you to do.  %RA might just be able to do this thing.\n"
"\n"
"\"Return to us when you have learned more, my %S.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1825
msgid "[The ancient forest grove is surrounded by centaurs.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1827
msgid ""
"You arrive in familiar surroundings.  In the distance, you %x the\n"
"ancient forest grove, the place of worship to %d.\n"
"\n"
"Something is wrong, though.  Surrounding the grove are centaurs!\n"
"And they've noticed you!"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1834
msgid ""
"[You descend into a subterranean complex.  Hooves clatter in the distance.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1836
msgid ""
"You descend into a weird place, in which roughly cut cave-like walls\n"
"join with smooth, finished ones, as if someone was in the midst of\n"
"finishing off the construction of a subterranean complex.\n"
"\n"
"Off in the distance, you hear a sound like the clattering of many\n"
"hooves on rock."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1844
msgid "Once again, you enter the distorted castle of %n."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1847
msgid "[You pick up %o and feel power.  It's time to return %oh to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1849
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, it seems to glow, and a warmth\n"
"fills you completely.  You realize that its power is what has protected\n"
"your %sp against their enemies for so long.\n"
"\n"
"You must now return it to %l without delay -- their lives depend\n"
"on your speed."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1871
msgid "[You have the Amulet!  Take it to the Astral Plane and offer it to %d.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1873
msgid ""
"\"You have it!  You have recovered the Amulet of Yendor!\n"
"Now attend to me, %p, and I will tell you what must be done:\n"
"\n"
"\"The Amulet has within it magic, the capability to transport you to\n"
"the Astral Plane, where the primary circle of %d resides.\n"
"\n"
"\"To activate this magic, you must travel upwards as far as you can.\n"
"When you reach the temple, sacrifice the Amulet to %d.\n"
"\n"
"\"Thus will you fulfill your destiny.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1887
msgid ""
"%nC collapses to the ground, cursing you and %l, then says:\n"
"\n"
"    \"You have defeated me, %r!  But I curse you one final time, with\n"
"    my dying breath!  You shall die before you leave my castle!\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1893
msgid "[You have returned, %p.  We need your help.  Are you ready?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1895
msgid ""
"\"%pC!  You have returned!  Thank %d.\n"
"\n"
"\"We have great need of you.  But first, I must see if you have the\n"
"required abilities to take on this responsibility.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1901
msgid "[You are not sufficiently %a.  We renounce your %shood.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1903
msgid ""
"\"%pC!  You have doomed us all.  You fairly radiate %L influences\n"
"and weaken the power we have raised in this grove as a result!\n"
"\n"
"\"Begone!  We renounce your %shood with us!  You are an outcast now!\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1915
msgid "[This is %i.  There are bats nearby.  Beware the wumpus!]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1917
msgid ""
"This must be %i.\n"
"\n"
"You are in a cave built of many different rooms, all interconnected\n"
"by tunnels.  Your quest is to find and shoot the evil wumpus that\n"
"resides elsewhere in the cave without running into any bottomless\n"
"pits or using up your limited supply of arrows.  Good luck.\n"
"\n"
"You are in room 9 of the cave.  There are tunnels to rooms\n"
"5, 8, and 10.\n"
"*rustle* *rustle* (must be bats nearby.)\n"
"*sniff* (I can smell the evil wumpus nearby!)"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1930
msgid "[You are in %i.  There are pits.  There are bats nearby.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1932
msgid ""
"Once again, you descend into %i.\n"
"\n"
"*whoosh* (I feel a draft from some pits.)\n"
"*rustle* *rustle* (must be bats nearby.)"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1938
msgid "[You have come to recover %o, but I shall keep %oh and you shall die.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1940
msgid ""
"\"So, %c.  %lC has sent you to recover %o.\n"
"\n"
"\"Well, I shall keep that bauble.  It pleases me.  You, %c, shall die.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1951
msgid ""
"\"I shall have %o from you, %r.  Then I shall\n"
"kill you.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1958
msgid "[You have succeeded.  Take %o with you as you go to find the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1960
msgid ""
"\"%pC!  You have succeeded!  I feared it was not possible!\n"
"\n"
"\"You have returned with %o!\n"
"\n"
"\"I fear, now, that the Centaurs will regroup and plot yet another raid.\n"
"This will take some time, but if you can recover the Amulet of Yendor\n"
"for %d before that happens, we will be eternally safe.\n"
"\n"
"\"Take %o with you.  It will aid in your quest for\n"
"the Amulet.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1972
msgid "[You are the keeper of %o now.  Go and find the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1974
msgid ""
"%l flexes %o reverently.\n"
"\n"
"\"With this wondrous bow, one need never run out of arrows.\n"
"You are its keeper now, and the time has come to resume your\n"
"search for the Amulet.  %Z await your return\n"
"through the magic portal that brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1982
msgid ""
"You have the oddest feeling that this may be the last time you\n"
"are to enter %H."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1986
msgid ""
"\"Welcome, %p.  How have you fared on your quest for the Amulet\n"
"of Yendor?\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:1992
msgid "[Get %o from %n and bring it to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:1994
msgid ""
"\"Will everyone not going to retrieve %o from that\n"
"jerk, %n, take one step backwards.  Good choice,\n"
"%p, because I was going to send you anyway.  My other %gp\n"
"are too valuable to me.\n"
"\n"
"\"Here's the deal.  I want %o, %n\n"
"has %o.  You are going to get %o\n"
"and bring it back to me.  So simple an assignment even you can understand\n"
"it.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2005
msgid "[Come back when you are really %a.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2007
msgid ""
"\"Maybe I should chain you to my perch here for a while.  Perhaps watching\n"
"real %a men at work will bring some sense back to you.  I don't\n"
"think I could stand the sight of you for that long though.  Come back\n"
"when you can be trusted to act properly.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2013
msgid "[%rA is not adequately trained to handle this job.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2015
msgid ""
"\"In the time that you've been gone you've only been able to master the\n"
"arts of %ra?  I've trained ten times again as many %Rp\n"
"in that time.  Maybe I should send one of them, no?  Where would that\n"
"leave you, %p?  Oh yeah, I remember, I was going to kill you!\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2045
msgid "[You are in Ransmannsby, where you trained.  Find %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2047
msgid ""
"Unexpectedly, you find yourself back in Ransmannsby, where you trained to\n"
"be a thief.  Quickly you make the guild sign, hoping that you AND word\n"
"of your arrival reach %ls den."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2052
msgid "[You sense %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2054
msgid ""
"You feel a great swelling up of courage, sensing the presence of\n"
"%o.  Or is it fear?"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2058
msgid "The hairs on the back of your neck whisper -- it's fear."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2061
msgid "[You pick up %o and know that %l should not have it.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2063
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, the hairs on the back of your\n"
"neck fall out.  At once you realize why %n was\n"
"willing to die to keep it out of %ls hands.  Somehow\n"
"you know that you must do likewise."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2083
msgid "[Take the Amulet to the Astral Plane and find %ds temple.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2085
msgid ""
"\"I see that with your abilities, and my brains, we could rule this world.\n"
"\n"
"\"All that we would need to be all-powerful is for you to take that little\n"
"trinket you've got there up to the Astral Plane.  From there, %d will\n"
"show you what to do with it.  Once that's done, we will be invincible!\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2092
msgid "[Before dying, %n tells you to use the %o wisely.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2094
msgid ""
"\"I know what you are thinking, %p.  It is not too late for you\n"
"to use %o wisely.  For the sake of your guild\n"
"%sp, do what is right.\"\n"
"\n"
"You sit and wait for death to come for %n, and then you\n"
"brace yourself for your next meeting with %l!"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2102
msgid ""
"[You owe back dues to your guild.  You can pay them off if you're up to the "
"job.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2104
msgid ""
"\"Well, look who it is boys -- %p has come home.  You seem to have\n"
"fallen behind in your dues.  I should kill you as an example to these\n"
"other worthless cutpurses, but I have a better plan.  If you are ready\n"
"maybe you could work off your back dues by performing a little job for\n"
"me.  Let us just see if you are ready...\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2111
msgid "[You must go.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2113
msgid ""
"\"Well %gp, it looks like our friend has forgotten who is the boss\n"
"around here.  Our friend seems to think that %rp have been put in\n"
"charge.  Wrong.  DEAD WRONG!\"\n"
"\n"
"Your sudden shift in surroundings prevents you from hearing the end\n"
"of %ls curse."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2121
msgid "[Are you stupid or are you ready?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2123
msgid ""
"\"Well, I didn't expect to see you back.  It shows that you are either "
"stupid,\n"
"or you are finally ready to accept my offer.  Let us hope for your sake it\n"
"isn't stupidity that brings you back.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2128
msgid ""
"\"Did you perhaps mistake me for some other %lt?  You must\n"
"think me as stupid as your behavior.  I warn you not to try my patience.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2132
msgid "Those damn little hairs tell you that you are nearer to %o."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2135
msgid "Not wanting to face %l without having stolen %o, you continue."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2144
msgid "[You cannot trust %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2146
msgid ""
"\"Surely, %p, you have learned that you cannot trust any bargains\n"
"that %l has made.  I can show you how to continue on\n"
"your quest without having to run into him again.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2151
msgid "[%lC should not have %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2153
msgid ""
"\"Please, think for a moment about what you are doing.  Do you truly\n"
"believe that %d would want %l to have\n"
"%o?\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2158
msgid ""
"Once again, you find yourself back in Ransmannsby.  Fond memories are\n"
"replaced by fear, knowing that %l is waiting for you."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2162
msgid "[Take %o with you and go.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2164
msgid ""
"\"Well, I'll be damned.  You got it.  I am proud of you, a fine %r\n"
"you've turned out to be.\n"
"\n"
"\"While you were gone I got to thinking, you and %o\n"
"together could bring me more treasure than either of you apart, so why "
"don't\n"
"you take it with you.  All I ask is a cut of whatever loot you come by.\n"
"That is a better deal than I offered %n.\n"
"\n"
"\"But, you see what happened to %n when he refused.\n"
"Don't make me find another to send after you this time.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2176
msgid "[Take %o and acquire the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2178
msgid ""
"%lC seems tempted to swap %o for\n"
"the mundane one you detect in his pocket, but noticing your alertness,\n"
"evidently chickens out.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go filch the Amulet before someone else beats you to it.\n"
"%Z are back the way you came, through the magic portal.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2186
msgid ""
"You rub your hands through your hair, hoping that the little ones on\n"
"the back of your neck stay down, and prepare yourself for your meeting\n"
"with %l."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2191
msgid "[How about trading %o for something?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2193
msgid ""
"\"Quite the little thief, aren't we, %p.  Can I interest you in a\n"
"swap for %o?  Look around, anything in the keep\n"
"is yours for the asking.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2200
msgid "[You must enter %i, then regain %o from %n.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2202
msgid ""
"\"Domo %p-san, indeed you are ready.  I can now tell you what\n"
"it is that I require of you.\n"
"\n"
"\"The daimyo, %n, has betrayed us.  He has stolen from us\n"
"%o and taken it to his donjon deep within\n"
"%i.\n"
"\n"
"\"If I cannot show the emperor %o when he comes\n"
"for the festival he will know that I have failed in my duty, and\n"
"request that I commit seppuku.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must gain entrance to %i and retrieve the\n"
"emperor's property.  Be quick!  The emperor will be here for the\n"
"cha-no-you in 5 sticks.\n"
"\n"
"\"Wakarimasu ka?\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2220
msgid "[When you can think %a and act %a then return.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2222
msgid ""
"\"%p-san, you would do better to join the kyokaku.\n"
"\n"
"\"You have skills, but until you can call upon the bushido to know when and\n"
"how to use them you are not samurai.  When you can think %a and\n"
"act %a then return.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2231
msgid ""
"\"%p-san, you have learned well and honored your family.\n"
"I require the skills of %Ra in order to defeat %n.\n"
"Go and seek out teachers.  Learn what they have learned.  When you\n"
"are ready, return to me.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2261
msgid "[The banner of %n flies above town.  What has happened to %l?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2263
msgid ""
"Even before your senses adjust, you recognize the kami of\n"
"%H.\n"
"\n"
"You %x the standard of your teki, %n, flying above\n"
"the town.  How could such a thing have happened?  Why are ninja\n"
"wandering freely; where are the samurai of your daimyo, %l?\n"
"\n"
"You quickly say a prayer to Izanagi and Izanami and walk towards\n"
"town."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2274
msgid "As you arrive once again at the home of %n."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2277
msgid ""
"[You feel the taunts %n, but after offering a prayer to %d, you proceed.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2279
msgid ""
"In your mind, you hear the taunts of %n.\n"
"\n"
"You become like the rice plant and bend to the ground, offering a\n"
"prayer to %d.  But when the wind has passed, you stand\n"
"proudly again.  Putting your kami in the hands of fate, you advance."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2286
msgid ""
"As you arrive once again at the home of %n, your thoughts\n"
"turn only to %o."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2290
msgid "[You feel the power of %o and are humbled.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2292
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, you feel the strength of its karma.\n"
"You realize at once why so many good samurai had to die to defend it.\n"
"You are humbled knowing that you hold one of the artifacts of the\n"
"sun goddess."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2312
msgid "[Take the Amulet to the Astral Plane to finish your task.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2314
msgid ""
"\"Ah, %p-sama.  You have wasted your efforts returning home.\n"
"Now that you are in possession of the Amulet, you are honor-bound to\n"
"finish the quest you have undertaken.  There will be plenty of time\n"
"for saki and stories when you have finished.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go now, and may our prayers be a wind at your back.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2322
msgid "[%nC dies without honor.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2324
msgid ""
"Your healing skills tell you that %ns wounds are mortal.\n"
"\n"
"You know that the bushido tells you to finish him and let his kami\n"
"die with honor, but the thought of so many samurai dead due to this\n"
"man's dishonor prevents you from giving the final blow.\n"
"\n"
"You order that his unwashed head be given to the crows and his body\n"
"thrown into the sea."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2334
msgid "[%lC needs someone to lead %lj samurai against %n.  Are you ready?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2336
msgid ""
"\"Ah, %p-san, it is good to see you again.  I need someone who can\n"
"lead my samurai against %n.  If you are ready, you will be\n"
"that person.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2341
msgid "[Leave and do not come back.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2343
msgid ""
"\"You are no longer my samurai, %p.\n"
"\n"
"\"Hara-kiri is denied.  You are ordered to shave your head and then to\n"
"become a monk.  Your fief and family are forfeit.  Wakarimasu ka?\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2349
msgid ""
"\"Once again, %p-san, you kneel before me.  Are you yet capable of\n"
"being my vassal?\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2353
msgid "[Are you truly a samurai?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2355
msgid ""
"\"You begin to test my matsu, %p-san.\n"
"If you cannot determine what I want in a samurai, how can I rely on you\n"
"to figure out what I need from a samurai?\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2360
msgid ""
"You instinctively reach for your swords.  You do not recognize the\n"
"lay of this land, but you know that your teki are everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2364
msgid ""
"Thankful that your %sp at %H cannot see\n"
"your fear, you prepare again to advance."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2368
msgid ""
"\"Ah, so it is to be you, %p-san.  I offer you seppuku.\n"
"I will be your second if you wish.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2372
msgid ""
"\"I have offered you the honorable exit.  Now I will have your\n"
"head to send unwashed to %l.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2379
msgid ""
"\"You have fought my samurai; surely you must know that you\n"
"will not be able to take %o back to\n"
"%H.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2387
msgid "[The emperor wants you to take %o and recover the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2389
msgid ""
"As you bow before %l, he welcomes you:\n"
"\n"
"    \"You have brought your family great honor, %p-sama.\n"
"\n"
"    \"While you have been gone the emperor's advisors have discovered in\n"
"    the ancient texts that the karma of the samurai who seeks to recover\n"
"    the Amulet and the karma of %o are joined\n"
"    as the seasons join to make a year.\n"
"\n"
"    \"Because you have shown such fidelity, the emperor requests\n"
"    that you take leave of other obligations and continue on the\n"
"    road that fate has set your feet upon.  I would consider it\n"
"    an honor if you would allow me to watch your household until\n"
"    you return with the Amulet.\"\n"
"\n"
"With that, %l bows, and places his sword atop\n"
"%o."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2408
msgid "[Take %o, return to %Z, and recover the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2410
msgid ""
"%l holds %o tightly for a moment, then returns\n"
"his gaze to you.\n"
"\n"
"\"The time is ripe to recover the Amulet.  Return to %Z\n"
"through the magic portal that transported you here so that you may\n"
"achieve the destiny which awaits you.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2418
msgid "[%HC is threatened by %n.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2420
msgid ""
"You are back at %H.\n"
"\n"
"Instantly you sense a subtle change in your karma.  You seem to know that\n"
"if you do not succeed in your quest, %n will have destroyed\n"
"the kami of %H before you return again."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2427
msgid "%lC bows.  \\"
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2432
msgid "[Enter %i and recover %o from %n.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2434
msgid ""
"\"You have indeed proven yourself a worthy %c, %p.\n"
"\n"
"\"But now your kinfolk and I must ask you to put aside your travels and\n"
"help us in our time of need.  After you left us we elected a new mayor,\n"
"%n.  He proved to be a most heinous and vile creature.\n"
"\n"
"\"Soon after taking office he absconded with %o\n"
"and fled town, leaving behind his henchmen to rule over us.  In order\n"
"for us to regain control of our town, you must enter %i\n"
"and recover %o.\n"
"\n"
"\"Do not be distracted on your quest.  If you do not return quickly I fear\n"
"that all will be lost.  Let us both pray now that %d will guide you\n"
"and keep you safe.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2450
msgid "[You are not sufficiently %a.  Return when you are.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2452
msgid ""
"\"It would be an affront to %d to have one not true to the\n"
"%a path undertake her bidding.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must not return to us until you have purified yourself of these\n"
"bad influences on your actions.  Remember, only by following the %a\n"
"path can you hope to overcome the obstacles you will face.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2460
msgid "[Return when you are %Ra.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2462
msgid ""
"\"There is still too much that you have to learn before you can undertake\n"
"the next step.  Return to us as a proven %R, and perhaps then\n"
"you will be ready.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go back now, and may the teachings of %d serve you well.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2493
msgid "[You find yourself back at %H, but the quiet is ominous.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2495
msgid ""
"You breathe a sigh of relief as you find yourself back in the familiar\n"
"surroundings of %H.\n"
"\n"
"You quickly notice that things do not appear the way they did when you\n"
"left.  The town is dark and quiet.  There are no sounds coming from\n"
"behind the town walls, and no campfires burning in the fields.  As a\n"
"matter of fact, you do not %x any movement in the fields at all, and\n"
"the crops seem as though they have been untended for many weeks."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2508
msgid "You sense the presence of %o."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2511
msgid ""
"You gain confidence, knowing that you may soon be united with\n"
"%o."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2515
msgid "[You pick up %o and feel relief.  Return it to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2517
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, you feel a great\n"
"weight has been lifted from your shoulders.  Your only thoughts are\n"
"to quickly return to %H and find %l."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2536
msgid ""
"[You have the Amulet.  Take it to the Astral Plane to finish your task.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2538
msgid ""
"\"Stand back and let me look at you, %p.\n"
"Now that you have recovered the Amulet of Yendor, I'm afraid living\n"
"out your days in %H would seem pretty tame.\n"
"\n"
"\"You have come too far to stop now, for there are still more tasks that\n"
"our oral history foretells for you.  Forever more, though, your name shall\n"
"be spoken by the %gP with awe.  You are truly an inspiration to your\n"
"%sp!\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2548
msgid "[%nC curses at you as %nh dies.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2550
msgid ""
"You turn in the direction of %n.  As his earthly body begins\n"
"to vanish before your eyes, you hear him curse:\n"
"\n"
"    \"You shall never be rid of me, %p!\n"
"    I will find you where ever you go and regain what is rightly mine.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2557
msgid "[Someone must defeat %n.  Are your ready?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2559
msgid ""
"\"Is it really you, %p!  I had given up hope for your return.\n"
"As you can %x, we are desperately in need of your talents.  Someone must\n"
"defeat %n if our town is to become what it once was.\n"
"\n"
"\"Let me see if you are ready to be that someone.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2566
msgid "[Leave %H and never return.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2568
msgid ""
"\"It is too late, %p.  You are not even worthy to die amongst us.\n"
"Leave %H and never return.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2578
msgid "[You %x the handiwork of %ns henchlings.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2580
msgid ""
"Only your faith in %d keeps you from trembling.  You %x\n"
"the handiwork of %ns henchlings everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2584
msgid "You know that this time you must find and destroy %n."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2587
msgid "[%rA will not defeat me.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2589
msgid ""
"\"So, %p, %l thinks that you can wrest\n"
"%o from me!\n"
"\n"
"\"It only proves how desperate he has become that he sends %ra to\n"
"try to defeat me.  When this day is over, I will have you enslaved\n"
"in the mines where you will rue the day that you ever entered\n"
"%i.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2598
msgid ""
"\"I let you live the last time because it gave me pleasure.\n"
"This time I will destroy you, %p.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2602
msgid "[Run away or you will suffer severely.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2604
msgid ""
"\"These meetings come to bore me.  You disturb my workings with\n"
"%o.\n"
"\n"
"\"If you do not run away now, I will inflict so much suffering on you that\n"
"%l will feel guilty for ever having sent his %S to me!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2613
msgid ""
"\"You fool.  You do not know how to call upon the powers of\n"
"%o.\n"
"\n"
"\"Return it to me and I will teach you how to use it, and together we\n"
"will rule %H.  But do so now, as my patience grows thin.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2623
msgid "[Take %o and with %ds guidance, recover the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2625
msgid ""
"As %l detects the presence of %o,\n"
"he almost smiles for the first time in many a full moon.\n"
"\n"
"As he looks up from %o he says:\n"
"\n"
"    \"You have recovered %o.  You are its\n"
"    owner now, but not its master.  Let it work with you as you continue\n"
"    your journey.  With its help, and %d to guide you on the\n"
"    %a path, you may yet recover the Amulet of Yendor.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2636
msgid "[Keep %o and return to %Z through the portal.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2638
msgid ""
"\"%oC is yours now.  %Z\n"
"await your return through the magic portal that brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2642
msgid ""
"You are back at %H.\n"
"Things appear to have become so bad that you fear that soon\n"
"%H will not be here to return to."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2647
msgid ""
"\"I could not be more proud than if you were my own %S, %p!\n"
"Tell me of your adventures in quest of the Amulet of Yendor.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2653
msgid "[Find %i; defeat %n; return with %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2655
msgid ""
"\"It is not clear, %p, for my sight is limited without our relic.\n"
"But it is now likely that you can defeat %n, and recover\n"
"%o.\n"
"\n"
"\"A short time ago, %n and his minions attacked this place.  They\n"
"opened the huge volcanic vents you %x about the hill, and attacked.  I knew\n"
"that this was to come to pass, and had asked %d for a group of %gP\n"
"to help defend this place.  The few you %x here are the mightiest of\n"
"Valhalla's own, and are all that are left of one hundred %d sent.\n"
"\n"
"\"Despite the great and glorious battle we fought, %n managed at\n"
"last to steal %o.  This has upset the balance of the universe,\n"
"and unless %oh is returned into my care, %n may start Ragnarok.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must find the entrance to %i.  Travel downward\n"
"from there and you will find %ns lair.  Defeat him and\n"
"return %o to me.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2674
msgid "[You have strayed from the %a path.  Return after you purify yourself.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2676
msgid ""
"\"NO!  This is terrible.  I see you becoming an ally of %n, and\n"
"leading his armies in the final great battles.  This must not come to\n"
"pass!  You have strayed from the %a path.  You must purge yourself,\n"
"and return here only when you have regained a state of purity.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2682
msgid "[Come back when you are %Ra.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2684
msgid ""
"\"I see you and %n fighting, %p.  But you are not prepared and\n"
"shall die at %ns hand if you proceed.  No.  This will not do.\n"
"Go back out into the world, and grow more experienced at the ways of war.\n"
"Only when you have returned %Ra will you be able to defeat %n.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2714
msgid "[You arrive below %H.  Something is wrong; there is lava present.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2716
msgid ""
"You materialize at the base of a snowy hill.  Atop the hill sits\n"
"a place you know well, %H.  You immediately realize\n"
"that something here is very wrong!\n"
"\n"
"In places, the snow and ice have been melted into steaming pools of\n"
"water.  Fumaroles and pools of bubbling lava surround the hill.\n"
"The stench of sulphur is carried through the air, and you %x creatures\n"
"that should not be able to live in this environment moving towards you."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2726
msgid "[This is the lair of %n.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2728
msgid ""
"Through clouds of sulphurous gasses, you %x a rock palisade\n"
"surrounded with a moat of bubbling lava.  You remember the description\n"
"from something that %l said.  This is the lair of %n."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2733
msgid "Once again, you stand in sight of %ns lair."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2736
msgid "[You must return %o to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2738
msgid ""
"As you pick up %o, your mind is suddenly filled with images,\n"
"and you perceive all of the possibilities of each potential choice you\n"
"could make.  As you begin to control and channel your thoughts, you\n"
"realize that you must return %o to %l immediately."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2758
msgid "[Take the Amulet to %ds temple on the Astral Plane and offer it.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2760
msgid ""
"\"Excellent, %p.  I see you have recovered the Amulet!\n"
"\n"
"\"You must take the Amulet to the Great Temple of %d, on the Astral\n"
"Plane.  There you must offer the Amulet to %d.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go now, my %S.  I cannot tell you your fate, as the power of the\n"
"Amulet interferes with mine.  I hope for your success.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2769
msgid "[%nC dies.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2771
msgid ""
"A look of surprise and horror appears on %ns face.\n"
"\n"
"    \"No!!!  %o has lied to me!  I have been misled!\"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, %n grasps his head and screams in agony, then dies."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2778
msgid "[We need your aid.  Are you ready?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2780
msgid ""
"\"Ah, %p, my %S.  You have returned to %H\n"
"at last.  We are in dire need of your aid, but I must determine if you\n"
"are yet ready for such an undertaking.\n"
"\n"
"\"Let me read your fate...\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2789
msgid ""
"\"No, %p.  Your fate is sealed.  I must cast about for another\n"
"champion.  Begone from my presence, and never return.  Know this, that\n"
"you shall never succeed in this life, and Valhalla is denied to you.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2794
msgid ""
"\"Let me read the future for you now, %p, perhaps you have managed to\n"
"change it enough...\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2798
msgid ""
"\"Again, I shall read your fate, my %S.  Let us both hope that you have\n"
"made changes to become ready for this task...\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2802
msgid "[This is the entrance to %i.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2804
msgid ""
"The ice and snow gives way to a valley floor.  You %x ahead of you\n"
"a huge round hill surrounded by pools of lava.  This then is the entrance\n"
"to %i.  It looks like you're not going to get in without\n"
"a fight though."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2810
msgid "Once again, you stand before the entrance to %i."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2815
msgid ""
"\"So!  %lC has finally sent %ca to challenge me!\n"
"\n"
"\"I thought that mastering %o would enable me to challenge\n"
"%d, but it has shown me that first I must kill you!  So come, little\n"
"%s.  Once I defeat you, I can at last begin the final battle with %d.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2831
msgid "Once again, you are near the abode of %l."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2834
msgid "[Take %o.  Search for the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2836
msgid ""
"As you approach, %l rises and touches %o.\n"
"\n"
"\"You may take %o with you, %p.  I have removed from\n"
"it the power to foretell the future, for that power no mortal should\n"
"have.  Its other abilities, however, you have at your disposal.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must now begin in %ds name to search for the Amulet of Yendor.\n"
"May your steps be guided by %d, my %S.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2846
msgid ""
"[You are %os keeper now.  Return through the portal and find the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2854
msgid ""
"Again you materialize near %ls abode.  You have a nagging feeling\n"
"that this may be the last time you come here."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2858
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, %p.  I have not been able to pay as much attention to\n"
"your search for the Amulet as I have wished.  How do you fare?\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2864
msgid "[Travel to %i; overcome %n; return with %o.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2866
msgid ""
"\"Yes, %p, you truly are ready for this dire task.  Listen,\n"
"carefully, for what I tell you now will be of vital importance.\n"
"\n"
"\"Since you left us to hone your skills in the world, we unexpectedly came\n"
"under attack by the forces of %n.  As you know, we thought\n"
"%n had perished at the end of the last age, but, alas, this was\n"
"not the case.\n"
"\n"
"\"%nC sent an army of abominations against us.  Among them was a\n"
"minion, mindless and ensorcelled, and thus, in the confusion, it was\n"
"able to penetrate our defenses.  Alas, this creature has stolen\n"
"%o and I fear has delivered %oh to %n.\n"
"\n"
"\"Over the years, I had woven most of my power into this amulet, and thus,\n"
"without it, I have but a shadow of my former power, and I fear that I\n"
"shall soon perish.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must travel to %i, and within its dungeons,\n"
"find and overcome %n, and return %o to me.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go now, with %d, and complete this quest before it is too late.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2889
msgid "[Go; come back when you are worthy of %d.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2891
msgid ""
"\"You amaze me, %p!  How many times did I tell you that the way of a mage\n"
"is an exacting one.  One must use the world with care, lest one leave it\n"
"in ruins and simplify the task of %n.\n"
"\n"
"\"You must go back and show your worthiness.  Do not return until you are\n"
"truly ready for this quest.  May %d guide you in this task.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2899
msgid "[Go; return when you are %Ra.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2901
msgid ""
"\"Alas, %p, you have not yet shown your proficiency as a worthy\n"
"spellcaster.  As %ra, you would surely be overcome in the challenge\n"
"ahead.  Go, now, expand your horizons, and return when you have attained\n"
"renown as %Ra.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2931
msgid "[You have arrived at %ls tower but something is very wrong.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2933
msgid ""
"You are suddenly in familiar surroundings.  You notice what appears to\n"
"be a large, squat stone structure nearby.  Wait!  That looks like the\n"
"tower of your former teacher, %l.\n"
"\n"
"However, things are not the same as when you were last here.  Mists and\n"
"areas of unexplained darkness surround the tower.  There is movement in\n"
"the shadows.\n"
"\n"
"Your teacher would never allow such unaesthetic forms to surround the\n"
"tower...  unless something were dreadfully wrong!"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2948
msgid "You feel your mentor's presence; perhaps %o is nearby."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2951
msgid "The aura of %o tingles at the edge of your perception."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2954
msgid "[You feel %os power and know you should return %oh to %l.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2956
msgid ""
"As you touch %o, its comforting power infuses you\n"
"with new energy.  You feel as if you can detect others' thoughts flowing\n"
"through it.  Although you yearn to wear %o and\n"
"attack the Wizard of Yendor, you know you must return it to its rightful\n"
"owner, %l."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:2977
msgid "[Take the Amulet to %ds altar on the Astral Plane.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2979
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations, %p.  I always knew that if anyone could succeed\n"
"in defeating the Wizard of Yendor and his minions, it would be you.\n"
"\n"
"\"Go now, and take the Amulet to the Astral Plane.  Once there, present\n"
"the Amulet on the altar of %d.  Along the way you shall pass through\n"
"the four Elemental Planes.  These planes are like nothing you have ever\n"
"experienced before, so be prepared!\n"
"\n"
"\"For this you were born, %s!  I am very proud of you.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:2992
msgid ""
"%nC, whose body begins to shrivel up, croaks out:\n"
"\n"
"    \"I shall haunt your progress until the end of time.  A thousand\n"
"    curses on you and %l.\"\n"
"\n"
"Then, the body bursts into a cloud of choking dust, and blows away."
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:3000
msgid "[You have come a long way, but are you ready for the task I require?]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3002
msgid ""
"\"Come closer, %p, for my voice falters in my old age.\n"
"Yes, I see that you have come a long way since you went out into the\n"
"world, leaving the safe confines of this tower.  However, I must first\n"
"determine if you have all of the skills required to take on the task\n"
"I require of you.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3011
msgid ""
"\"You fool, %p!  Why did I waste all of those years teaching you\n"
"the esoteric arts?  Get out of here!  I shall find another.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3018
msgid ""
"\"This is getting tedious, %p, but perseverance is a sign of a true mage.\n"
"I certainly hope that you are truly ready this time!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3022
msgid "Wisps of fog swirl nearby.  You feel that %ns lair is close."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3025
msgid "You believe that you may once again invade %i."
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3030
msgid ""
"\"Ah, I recognize you, %p.  So, %l has sent you to steal\n"
"%o from me, hmmm?  Well, %lh is a fool to send such\n"
"a mental weakling against me.\n"
"\n"
"\"Your destruction, however, should make for good sport.  In the end, you\n"
"shall beg me to kill you!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3040
msgid ""
"\"How nice of you to return, %p!  I enjoyed our last meeting.  Are you\n"
"still hungry for more pain?\n"
"\n"
"\"Come!  Your soul, like %o, shall soon be mine to command.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3046
msgid ""
"\"I'm sure that your perseverance shall be the subject of innumerable\n"
"ballads, but you shall not be around to hear them, I fear!\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3050
msgid ""
"\"Thief!  %oC belongs to me, now.  I shall feed\n"
"your living flesh to my minions.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:3057
msgid "[Take %o with you in your quest for the Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3059
msgid ""
"%lC notices %o in your possession,\n"
"beams at you and says:\n"
"\n"
"    \"I knew you could defeat %n and retrieve\n"
"    %o.  We shall never forget this\n"
"    brave service.\n"
"\n"
"    \"Take %oh with you in your quest for the Amulet of Yendor.\n"
"    I can sense that it has attuned %oiself to you already.\n"
"\n"
"    \"May %d guide you in your quest, and keep you from harm.\""
msgstr ""

#. synopsis field
#: dat/quest.lua:3072
msgid "[Keep %o, return through the portal to %Z; find the other Amulet.]"
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3074
msgid ""
"\"You are the keeper of %o now.  It is time to\n"
"recover the /other/ Amulet.  %Z await your return through\n"
"the magic portal which brought you here.\""
msgstr ""

#. text field
#: dat/quest.lua:3083
msgid ""
"\"Come near, my %S, and share your adventures with me.\n"
"So, have you succeeded in your quest for the Amulet of Yendor?\""
msgstr ""

